        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ઉગારવું",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉગારવું — ugārvũ — \"to rescue\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અરુણે નદીમાંથી એક છોકરીને ઉગારી. Aruṇe nadīmā̃thī ek chokrīne ugārī. Arun rescued a girl from the river."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે બાળકને ઉગાર્યું, teṇe bāḷakne ugāryũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉગારવું (ugārvũ) is the causative of ugarvũ, to escape, which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit udgirati, \"spits out, gives out\" (CDIAL 1960): to make someone escape a danger. The person saved takes ને: છોકરીને ઉગારી."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
