              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઋણી (ṛṇī) is a tatsama, Sanskrit ṛṇin, \"one who is in debt\" (Monier-Williams), built on ṛṇa, a debt. It agrees with the speaker: a man says હું તમારો ઋણી છું, a woman તમારી ઋણી."
